stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> DRAFT

    DRAFT --> QUEUED: release
    DRAFT --> BLOCKED: block
    DRAFT --> CANCELLED: cancel

    QUEUED --> DRAFT: hold
    QUEUED --> RUNNING: claim
    QUEUED --> BLOCKED: block
    QUEUED --> FAILED: fail
    QUEUED --> CANCELLED: cancel

    RUNNING --> BLOCKED: task.blocked
    RUNNING --> SUCCEEDED: task.completed
