    RUNNING --> CANCELLED: task.cancelled
    RUNNING --> QUEUED: retry

    BLOCKED --> QUEUED: retry
    BLOCKED --> CANCELLED: cancel

    FAILED --> QUEUED: retry
    FAILED --> RUNNING: reconcile.started
    FAILED --> CANCELLED: cancel

    SUCCEEDED --> [*]
